SUMMARY:Pokémon GO: Mega Ascension
DESCRIPTION:Mega Ascension week prior to the Mega Finale event.\n\nDaily Mega Raid Rotation:\n- Mon, Aug 31: Mega Victreebel, Mega Dragonite, Mega Malamar\n- Tue, Sep 1: Mega Falinks\n- Wed, Sep 2: Mega Skarmory\n- Thu, Sep 3: Mega Starmie\n- Fri, Sep 4: Mega Raichu X, Mega Raichu Y\n- All Week: Mega Latias, Mega Latios\n\nBonuses:\n- Remote Raid Pass limit increased to 30.\n- Special Backgrounds available for Mega Raids.
END:VEVENT
